# https://antigravity.google/docs/models
# https://antigravity.google/docs/plans
# https://antigravity.google/docs/cli/credits/
# Subscription quotas/credits apply. Flash is the fast option; no verified
# per-selector quota-price table supports calling one definitively cheapest.
# Set ANTIGRAVITY_EFFORT consistently with low/medium/high suffixes.
ANTIGRAVITY_MODELS='
gemini-3.8-flash-low|fast,low-effort|listed-local|Current Flash, minimal reasoning effort
gemini-3.8-flash-medium|fast,balanced|listed-local|Current Flash, medium effort
gemini-3.8-flash-high|fast,reasoning|listed-local|Current Flash, high effort
gemini-3.7-flash-low|fast,low-effort,legacy|listed-local|Previous Flash
gemini-3.7-flash-medium|fast,balanced,legacy|listed-local|Previous Flash
gemini-3.7-flash-high|fast,reasoning,legacy|listed-local|Previous Flash
gemini-3.6-flash-low|fast,low-effort,legacy|listed-local|Older Flash
gemini-3.6-flash-medium|fast,balanced,legacy|listed-local|Older Flash
gemini-3.6-flash-high|fast,reasoning,legacy|listed-local|Older Flash
gemini-3.1-pro-low|frontier,low-effort|listed-local|Pro family available through this agent
gemini-3.1-pro-high|frontier,reasoning|listed-local|Pro family available through this agent
claude-sonnet-4-6|balanced,reasoning,legacy|listed-local|Thinking variant; separate third-party quota
claude-opus-4-6-thinking|frontier,reasoning,legacy|listed-local|Thinking variant; separate third-party quota
'

# COPILOT — toolkit Auto served gpt-6-luna; this is not a Luna pin.
# Installed CLI is 1.0.93-1 (2026-10-09). The historical 2026-10-02 Free-plan
# picker exposed only Auto; the current paid-model account list was not rechecked.
# https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/reference/ai-models/supported-models
# https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/concepts/models/auto-model-selection
# Empty MODEL_COPILOT means Auto; use an exact account-supported ID to override.
COPILOT_MODELS='
auto|auto,unpinned|verified-classification|Toolkit served Luna automatically; underlying model may change between trials
'
